│ 32, "title": "Chronic\xa0rhinosinusitis\xa0in\xa0Europe‐‐an\xa0underestimated\xa0disease. A\xa0GA²LEN\xa0study",     │
│ "abstract": "BACKGROUND Chronic rhinosinusitis (CRS) is a common health problem, with significant medical costs and  │
