│ triamcinolone‐impregnated nasal packing after endoscopic sinus surgery: a randomized, double‐blinded,                │
│ placebo‐controlled study", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Steroid-infused absorbable nasal dressings after endoscopic sinus │
